== 5. 공정 변수 ↔ 소자/제품 특성 상관관계

=== 5.1 DRAM: GOX ↔ GIDL / VRT / Row hammer / 리텐션

```text
   GOX thinner  -> higher gate-to-drain field -> GIDL up
                -> Vt down -> subthreshold leakage up
                -> more interface/oxide traps near junction -> VRT
                -> weaker isolation of passing WL coupling -> row hammer
   All paths converge on: storage node charge loss -> retention tail
```

